{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, יְתִב","hw":"יְתִב","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְתִב</span></big></big>  (K<sup>§ 25 a) β)</sup>) <strong>vb. sit, dwell (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָשַׁב\" href=\"/BDB,_יָשַׁב\", dir=\"rtl\">ישׁב</a><strong>)</strong>;—<strong>Pe </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>sit, be seated:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְתִ֑ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:9\" href=\"/Daniel.7.9\">Dn 7:9</a> and (of judgment = the judge) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:10\" href=\"/Daniel.7.10\">10</a>, so Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתִּ֑ב</span> (K<sup>§ 43, 1, Beisp. b</sup>), cf. BH <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, ישֵׁב בַּשֶּׁ֫בֶת\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_ישֵׁב בַּשֶּׁ֫בֶת\">יֵשֵׁב</a>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:26\" href=\"/Daniel.7.26\">7:26</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>dwell</em>, Pt. pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָתְבִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:17\" href=\"/Ezra.4.17\">Ezr 4:17</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ב</span> loc.). <strong>Haph.</strong> <em>cause to dwell:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹתֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">4:10</a> (acc. + ב loc.).","next":"BDB Aramaic, יַתִּיר","prev":"BDB Aramaic, יָת"}